   b) Use Shulkaero to play Minecraft: in singleplayer, and on your own or any other server.
   c) Show Shulkaero in videos, streams, screenshots, reviews and guides.

3. Modpacks
   You may include Shulkaero in modpacks, public or private, free or paid, and distribute it as part
   of such a modpack, but only in its original, unmodified state: the jar files exactly as
   CptGummiball published them, not renamed in content, not repackaged, not altered in any way.
